WEBVTT

00:01:57.121 --> 00:02:02.204
is to tell him how many people gained
entry when the fifth bell rang.

00:02:02.788 --> 00:02:04.663
Can you get into the rave?

00:02:05.746 --> 00:02:06.871
Pause here to figure it out yourself.

00:02:06.871 --> 00:02:07.996
Answer in 3

00:02:07.996 --> 00:02:10.496
Answer in 2

00:02:10.496 --> 00:02:12.704
Answer in 1

00:02:12.829 --> 00:02:16.246
It’s initially difficult to imagine 
how anyone could,

00:02:16.246 --> 00:02:20.163
using just logic and the colors
they see on the other masks,

00:02:20.163 --> 00:02:22.163
deduce their own mask color.

00:02:22.163 --> 00:02:26.829
But even before the first bell, everyone
will realize something critical.

00:02:27.996 --> 00:02:31.621
Let’s imagine a single logician
with a silver mask.